 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"万竹阴中屋数间，几回剥啄叩柴关。\n忽开短纸霜雪干，如对照人冰玉颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47468,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观徐复州家书画七首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"旷怀谁不作山游，谁似柳州谈永州。\n何能乞我一片石，刻此数纸俱传流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47469,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观徐复州家书画七首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"世人竞写襄阳字，政似云师太白诗。\n才匪若人宁躐等，自颠自醉祇成痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47470,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观徐复州家书画七首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"苏公书法自颜行，犹谓蔡公居第一。\n我穷颇亦类贾胡，笔势翩翩疑可识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47471,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观徐复州家书画七首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"草衣旧识牡丹碑，字字腾拿更倔奇。\n我亦参军成潦倒，愧无笔力欠渠诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47472,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观曾文清诗刻","author":"赵蕃","text":"我访茶山公已仙，向人惟有竹苍然。\n摩挲欲问当时事，竹不能言风为传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47473,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过王宗臣允元园庐三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"拟欲过君非一日，哭妻值我买船东。